## LocationApi

### List location areas
## List location areas
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/location-area/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### Get location area
## Get location area
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/location-area/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### List locations
## List locations
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/location/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### Get location
## Get location
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/location/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

